			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760360301,
					"content": "Will these do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360302,
					"content": "Yes. The kuuhenki looks quite satisfied.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360303,
					"content": "!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maalaus"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360304,
					"content": "Man, Paimon never knew kuuhenki could do art.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360305,
					"content": "Kuuhenki are much like us, in truth. Each one has its own personality and hobbies.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360306,
					"content": "Wait, does that mean you can tell all the kuuhenki in Nod-Krai apart from each other?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360307,
					"content": "The ones I've met, yes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360308,
					"content": "That's impressive! Especially because, other than Luonnotar, all the other kuuhenki kinda look the same...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360309,
					"content": "So, what is this little painter's name?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360310,
					"content": "Name...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360311,
					"content": "Wait... They do have names, don't they?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360312,
					"content": "We recognize each other, and that's enough. We don't need names... I don't have one either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360313,
					"content": "That doesn't mean mean you have to continue the cycle!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360314,
					"content": "Hmm... Let's think... \"Luonnotar\" means \"a creature born beneath the Moon Goddess's blessing\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360315,
					"content": "So... What would \"painting\" be in the language of the Frostmoon Scions?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360316,
					"content": "I think it would be... Maa... naus? Maalaus? Yes. Maalaus.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360317,
					"content": "Ooh, sounds nice! Let's go with that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360318,
					"content": "??",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maalaus"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360319,
					"content": "What is it, Maalaus? Done with your painting?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360320,
					"content": "!!!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maalaus"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360321,
					"content": "Ooh! Let's see, let's see... Whoa. What in the...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360322,
					"content": "What's the matter?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760360323,
					"content": "This is amazing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360324,
					"content": "Paimon was expecting something a lot more childish... or, y'know, Melusine-like...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360325,
					"content": "The kuuhenki are adept at sensing their surroundings. When it comes to recreating what they've seen, they tend to capture things exactly as they were.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360326,
					"content": "So, is this a drawing of Columbina, Maalaus?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360327
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760360327,
					"content": "!!!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maalaus"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360328,
					"content": "Hm...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360329,
					"content": "...It looks like Columbina when she was first born.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360330,
					"content": "Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760360331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760360331,
					"content": "Lauma said your birth was recorded by the Frostmoon Scions... But, this painting does look a bit different.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
